### 5. Database Design

The database stores and manages all important user and financial information.

#### Main Tables

**User Table**

| Field        | Description                |
| ------------ | -------------------------- |
| User_ID      | Unique user identification |
| Name         | User name                  |
| Email        | User email                 |
| Password     | Encrypted password         |
| Created_Date | Account creation date      |

**Income Table**

| Field     | Description      |
| --------- | ---------------- |
| Income_ID | Unique income ID |
| User_ID   | Associated user  |
| Source    | Income source    |
| Amount    | Income amount    |
| Date      | Income date      |

**Expense Table**

| Field       | Description       |
| ----------- | ----------------- |
| Expense_ID  | Unique expense ID |
| User_ID     | Associated user   |
| Category    | Expense category  |
| Amount      | Expense amount    |
| Description | Expense details   |
| Date        | Expense date      |

**Budget Table**

| Field          | Description            |
| -------------- | ---------------------- |
| Budget_ID      | Unique budget ID       |
| User_ID        | Associated user        |
| Month          | Budget month           |
| Total_Budget   | Total planned budget   |
| Spending_Limit | Maximum spending limit |

**Goal Table**

| Field         | Description            |
| ------------- | ---------------------- |
| Goal_ID       | Unique goal ID         |
| User_ID       | Associated user        |
| Goal_Name     | Name of financial goal |
| Target_Amount | Target amount          |
| Saved_Amount  | Current saved amount   |
| Deadline      | Target date            |

**Recommendation Table**

| Field             | Description               |
| ----------------- | ------------------------- |
| Recommendation_ID | Unique recommendation ID  |
| User_ID           | Associated user           |
| Category          | Related spending category |
| Recommendation    | AI-generated advice       |
