### 9. AI Recommendation Design

The recommendation process is designed as follows:

```text
User Financial Data
        │
        ▼
Data Collection
        │
        ▼
Data Cleaning & Processing
        │
        ▼
Spending Pattern Analysis
        │
        ▼
Identify High-Spending Areas
        │
        ▼
Compare With Budget
        │
        ▼
Generate Recommendations
        │
        ▼
Display Personalized Advice
```

The recommendation engine can use rule-based logic or machine-learning techniques depending on the implementation.

For example:

```text
IF Food Expense > Food Budget
THEN
    Recommend reducing food expenses

IF Monthly Expense > Monthly Budget
THEN
    Display overspending alert

IF Savings < Savings Target
THEN
    Recommend increasing monthly savings
```

