### 12. Expected Design Outcome

The design phase provides the blueprint for implementing **PocketSmart AI**. The proposed design integrates **user management, income and expense tracking, budget planning, financial analysis, AI-based recommendations, and reporting** into a single system.

The final system is designed to give users a clear view of their financial activities and provide personalized recommendations to help them manage their budgets more effectively.
